{"seq":13,"at":"2026-11-11T14:06:35.925Z","type":"report.text","job":"A","data":{"step":"search-1","provider":"search","text":"Notes for the report: the three approaches are not yet named, so first pin down which three are being compared (for example, IoT temperature monitoring, refrigeration equipment upgrades, and route or inventory-timing changes), since each has different costs and payback periods. Check how spoilage is measured in any source (shrink rate, waste as a share of sales, or temperature excursion counts), because figures from different measures cannot be compared directly. Verify that any cited savings come from regional grocers of comparable size and not from large national chains, and treat vendor-published results as claims to confirm independently."},"prev":"f3266fbecd5c32046293eefdd8198559674b52993de270cf49cbeec67b833d5e","hash":"b8a372ea1f1c75db9f73f5add7e4764567d17a0d83aecb0cccaca0ae4bd373b9"}
{"seq":14,"at":"2026-11-11T14:06:42.140Z","type":"payment","job":"A","data":{"provider":"lookup","step":"lookup-1","price":"0.030000","spent":"0.050000","status":200,"tries":1,"ms":6212,"invoice":"0x0c34471aa88f060e135db4d6080a013ef87e379594a16b019bd9556fadbfcc55:955cc5b5-7908-4544-a35e-f7f79c0ef805"},"prev":"b8a372ea1f1c75db9f73f5add7e4764567d17a0d83aecb0cccaca0ae4bd373b9","hash":"6511e198d4847ab85e4f6c040d6c0fc880a4a4a9563ab34eccc0de2e08ba7e04"}
{"seq":15,"at":"2026-11-11T14:06:42.142Z","type":"report.text","job":"A","data":{"step":"lookup-1","provider":"lookup","text":"Cold-chain spoilage comparisons for regional grocers usually hinge on three things: how each approach (for example, sensor-based monitoring, refrigeration equipment upgrades, and route or supplier logistics changes) is costed per store and per pallet, how spoilage is measured (shrink versus write-offs, and whether it is baseline-adjusted), and over what period the results were observed. Any figures you pull should be checked for source, date, sample size, and whether they come from vendor claims or independent trials, since none of this can be confirmed from here. I have no live lookup, so treat every number as unverified until you have retrieved and cited it yourself."},"prev":"6511e198d4847ab85e4f6c040d6c0fc880a4a4a9563ab34eccc0de2e08ba7e04","hash":"14b2bf6a4ee5a7a744bdb771f41b25d11efbf70303f3547917e6f82323fc8def"}
